<bold>Brain MRI of patient II-2 in Family 1.</bold> (<bold>A</bold>) Axial T1-weighted image showing atrophy of the cerebellar vermis. (<bold>B</bold>) Sagittal T1-weighted image showing cerebellar atrophy, particularly evident in the superior vermis, with enlargement of the fourth ventricle. (<bold>C</bold>) Coronal T1-weighted image showing no atrophy of the hippocampus and cerebrum.</p><p>(TIF)</p></caption><media xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="pone.0081884.s001.tif" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"><?cloudpmc-path 2366/3846781/7c205cd9364e/pone.0081884.s001.tif?><?cloudpmc-bucket app?><?size 359872?><caption><p>Click here for additional data file.</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material id="db_ds_supplementary-material2_reqid_" position="float"><?disp-level 2?><label>Figure S2</label><caption><p>
<bold>Brain MRI of patient II-3 in Family 1.</bold> (A) Axial T1-weighted image showing atrophy of the cerebellar vermis. (B) Sagittal T1-weighted image showing cerebellar atrophy, particularly evident in the superior vermis, with enlargement of the fourth ventricle. (C) Coronal T1-weighted image showing no atrophy of the hippocampus and cerebrum.</p><p>(TIF)</p></caption><media xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="pone.0081884.s002.tif" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"><?cloudpmc-path 2366/3846781/18934ecd8214/pone.0081884.s002.tif?><?cloudpmc-bucket app?><?size 1049964?><caption><p>Click here for additional data file.</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material id="db_ds_supplementary-material3_reqid_" position="float"><?disp-level 2?><label>Figure S3</label><caption><p>
<bold>Interactions of wide-type CHIP and its mutants with Fbx2 and NR2A.</bold> Expression vectors for CHIP, Fbx2 and NR2A were transfected into HEK293 cells. At 36h after transfection, Cell lysates were immunoprecipitated (IP) with anti-Flag antibody and bound proteins were revealed by immunoblot (IB) with anti-myc and anti-HA antibodies.</p><p>(TIF)</p></caption><media xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="pone.0081884.s003.tif" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"><?cloudpmc-path 2366/3846781/376fb8e09e35/pone.0081884.s003.tif?><?cloudpmc-bucket app?><?size 342106?><caption><p>Click here for additional data file.</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material id="db_ds_supplementary-material4_reqid_" position="float"><?disp-level 2?><label>File S1</label><caption><p>
